      "headline": "The NEP Process",
      "title": "The NEP Process",
      "status": "Active · **DORMANT until the v1 pre-freeze** (process NEP · never Final)",
      "type": "Process",
      "created": "2026-07-18",
      "author": "SuperNovae Studio maintainers",
      "lede": "A NEP (Nika Enhancement Proposal) is the public, numbered document through\nwhich every evolution of the Nika standard is proposed, discussed and\ndecided.",
